OL,3,GNEWSAHospital's A&E unit set to reopen 
OL,4,A24/7 after decade                      
OL,6,FA hospital's accident and emergency    
OL,7,Fdepartment for adults is set to offer a
OL,8,F24/7 service again for the first time  
OL,9,Fin more than a decade.                 
OL,11,FTen years ago, the A&E unit at Chorley 
OL,12,Fand South Ribble Hospital was put on   
OL,13,Freduced hours over concerns about      
OL,14,Fstaffing safety and finances. It       
OL,15,Fcurrently only operates between 08:00  
OL,16,Fand 20:00.                             
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
