OL,3,GNEWSAHospital's A&E unit set to reopen 
OL,4,A24/7 after decade                      
OL,6,FLancashire Teaching Hospitals NHS      
OL,7,FFoundation Trust and NHS Lancashire and
OL,8,FSouth Cumbria Integrated Care Board    
OL,9,F(ICB) have been working to review the  
OL,10,Fviability of an around-the-clock       
OL,11,Fservice.                               
OL,13,FThe ICB has now found the funding      
OL,14,Fneeded to restore the 24/7 service for 
OL,15,Fthe 2027/28 financial year. The trust  
OL,16,Fis now undertaking planning and        
OL,17,Frecruitment to enable it to do so.     
